### 1. 회원가입
POST http://localhost:8080/api/members/register
Content-Type: application/json

{"email": "apdkeb@gmail.com", "password": "test0123"}

### 2. 로그인 → JWT 토큰 발급
POST http://localhost:8080/api/members/login
Content-Type: application/json

{"email": "apdkeb@gmail.com", "password": "test0123"}

> {% client.global.set("token", response.body.token); %}

### 3. 카테고리 목록 조회
GET http://localhost:8080/api/categories

### 4. 상품 목록 조회
GET http://localhost:8080/api/products

### 5. 상품 옵션 조회 (상품 ID=1)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/products/1/options

### 6. 포인트 충전 (어드민 — 회원 ID 확인 후 사용)
POST http://localhost:8080/admin/members/1/charge-point
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

amount=10000000

### 7. 위시 추가 (상품 ID=1)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/wishes
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"productId": 1}

### 8. 위시 목록 조회
GET http://localhost:8080/api/wishes
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 9. 주문 생성 (옵션 ID=1, 수량 1)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/orders
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"optionId": 1, "quantity": 1, "message": "선물입니다!"}

### 10. 주문 목록 조회
GET http://localhost:8080/api/orders
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 11. 카카오 로그인 (브라우저에서 열기)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/auth/kakao/login
